        "created_at": "2015-03-16T14:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I made a strategy guide a while ago for Baron Blade's scenario, since a lot of new players play it and struggle. &nbsp;You can find it <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1224401/baron-blade-scenario-1-strategy-guide\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">over here</a>. (bgg)</p><p>For a summation always switch a power card to gain defense tokens, never take out battlesuit unless you are incapping everyone and generally switch between teleported and redistributer.</p>",
